# A binding borrows its bank, view and shader until the caller closes them.
# Each shader pass tracks its own uploaded revision of the immutable geometry.
import scene_buffers.dl
import shaders.dl

class:
    patterns:
        UI scene geometry binding
    members:
        bank as a pointer to UI scene mesh bank
        view as a pointer to UI view
        shader as a pointer
        pass as an integer
        revision as an integer

to get [a UI scene geometry binding to] {a pointer to UI scene mesh bank:bank} [in] {a pointer to UI view:view} [shader] {a pointer:shader} [pass] {integer:pass}:
    set checked to a UI operation integer from pass
    return @intrinsic("construct", UI scene geometry binding, bank, view, shader, pass, -1)

to get [refresh UI scene geometry binding] {a pointer to UI scene geometry binding:binding}:
    set bank to binding's bank
    if binding's revision = bank's revision:
        return false
    set UI shader (binding's shader) pass (binding's pass) in (binding's view) vertex buffer 0 from ((bank's vertices' data) as a pointer) spanning (((the length of bank's vertices) as a 64 bit integer) * 32) bytes
    set UI shader (binding's shader) pass (binding's pass) in (binding's view) vertex buffer 1 from ((bank's colors' data) as a pointer) spanning (((the length of bank's colors) as a 64 bit integer) * 12) bytes
    set UI shader (binding's shader) pass (binding's pass) in (binding's view) to indices (bank's indices' data) counting (the length of bank's indices)
    set binding's revision to bank's revision
    return true

to [upload UI scene instances] {UI scene shader instances:records} [through] {UI scene geometry binding:binding}:
    set UI shader (binding's shader) pass (binding's pass) in (binding's view) vertex buffer 2 from ((records' data) as a pointer) spanning (((the length of records) as a 64 bit integer) * 176) bytes

to get [a UI scene mesh draw from span] {integer:index} [in] {a pointer to UI scene mesh bank:bank} [counting] {integer:count} [instances starting at] {integer:first}:
    set span to the item at index in (bank's spans)
    return a UI shader draw counting (span's count) instanced count starting at (span's first index) with vertex offset (span's first vertex) and instance offset first indexed true
